    "detailed_description": "<h1>About A&amp;D</h1><p>A&amp;D Cooperation was founded in 2020 and has 2 developers. We are a very small studio an happy about every support we can get from you!<br>You want to support us? Buy our game and/or support us on Patreon!<br>Patreon: </p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413260/extras/154fe87376ef0495cc9dd3ef8f968ea7.avif?t=1640109843\" /></div><br>Traveler of Artcaster is an indie adventure Rpg taking place in the fanatsy world named &quot;Artcaster&quot;. You start at the small island named <strong>Romo</strong>. After years of waiting you are finally old enough to search you father, who was fighting for the King of Artcaster many years ago. You journey begins at the <strong>Angora Forest</strong> which is located at the North of Romo. At jour Journey you will get many friends and maybe a companion who helps you at the fights.<br>Traveler of Artcaster is an<strong> 2D Rpg game</strong> with a <strong>leveling and fighting system</strong>.  It uses a <strong>multiple choice framework</strong>. That means that you decide your own fate and every player may have a different ending.",
